WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.493
A pattern is a ready made group of components. Here we insert the Feature Cards pattern into a page.

2
00:00:08.493 --> 00:00:32.014
Open the Library, and switch to the Patterns tab.

3
00:00:32.014 --> 00:00:44.026
Right click Feature Cards, and choose Insert. The cards are added to the page.

4
00:00:44.026 --> 00:00:50.903
Each card is now a normal component. Select one to change its heading and text.
